  "description": "A world covered in thick fog. Raging witches became a serious threat to the royal capital, and the king created a professional hunter who only catches witches, not soldiers, in order to win the war against witches. However, despite the struggles of the witch hunters, the power of the witches is getting closer to the royal capital... .\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Comico (Expired)](https://comico.kr/titles/12916)  \n[Naver Webtoon (R19)](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=776306)  \nNaver Series ([R19](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6277935), [R15](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6476997))",
